+The 1180 engine routes only methods ending in `requestApproval`; an MCP
+`mcpServer/elicitation/request` falls through to a response with `{}`. That
+is not a valid MCP confirmation answer. Before the fix, the new stdio
+regression `computerUseConfirmationWaitsForTheUserAndRepliesWithMcpContent`
